BOSSgram branding v1 — rename + unique package + own settings entry (DrKLO/Telegram master, Oct 2026).
Applied on top of 0001-boss-hooks.patch in the build tree only. TMessagesProj_App/google-services.json
(the one the google-services plugin reads) values stay dummy: replace with your own Firebase project for working push.
Icons: generated by tools/make-icons.py, copied over icon_6_* slots (same filenames).

